HealthRecordApplicationService ..> DeviceAuthenticationFailed : raises
HealthRecordApplicationService ..> HealthRecordSaveResult : returns
HealthRecordRepositoryImpl ..|> IHealthRecordRepository
HealthRecordRepositoryImpl --> HealthRecordModel
HealthRecordRepositoryImpl ..> TelemetryEventConflict : raises
HealthRecordRepositoryImpl ..> HealthRecord : maps to/from
health_api --> HealthRecordCreateRequest : validates
health_api --> HealthRecordApplicationService : invokes

Device --> ApiCredential
